---
id: sign-in-trust
name: Sign-in Trust Note
description: A static privacy and security reassurance for the sign-in page.
category: Forms/Sign-in
attributes:
  message:
    type: string
    default: Private by design · Protected with care
    overridable: true
---
<style>
  .specux-sign-in-trust {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: #cfdbf8;
    font: 10px/1.5 Inter, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .specux-sign-in-trust__mark {
    display: grid;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    flex: 0 0 24px;
    place-items: center;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .24);
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: 11px;
  }
</style>
<div class="specux-sign-in-trust">
  <span class="specux-sign-in-trust__mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
  <span>${attributes.message}</span>
</div>
